          "published_on": "2026-09-04",
          "source": {
            "announcement_id": "1225545707",
            "page": 1,
            "sha256": "8da7586099fb06bdd0d6666d2bd100077a92b5e05c6e73e11d07403b3c5a7dce",
            "title": "*ST康佳A：关于本次终止上市事项的停牌公告",
            "url": "https://disc.static.szse.cn/download/disc/disk03/finalpage/2026-09-04/2d4e5a31-8f14-4283-aa1c-835246d90722.PDF#page=1"
          },
          "text": "9月4日起停牌；方案若获通过，停牌持续至摘牌。"
        },
        {
          "published_on": "2026-10-15",
          "source": {
            "announcement_id": "1225605494",
            "page": 2,
            "sha256": "d666b067b10579361cf69bac74e1fff0ed4214e77b397b62e0a30e10398707e6",
            "title": "*ST康佳A：关于以股东会决议方式主动终止公司股票上市现金选择权申报结果的公告",
            "url": "https://disc.static.szse.cn/download/disc/disk03/finalpage/2026-10-15/2a1b8b3d-7b41-40e1-92d3-c5ab65945d6f.PDF#page=2"
          },
          "text": "10月15日公告有效申报现金选择权已完成交收，A股有效申报989276152份；不能据此认证每个持有人的账户收益。"
        },
        {
          "published_on": "2026-10-23",
          "source": {
            "announcement_id": "1225615607",
            "page": 1,
            "sha256": "63d22af39ae73ee789d4492c4643f5a4b4ea02edfe51992d8752028b12dc320d",
            "title": "*ST康佳A：关于股票终止上市暨摘牌的公告",
